flowchart TB
  M["Mission contract<br/>Goal • constraints • success criteria"] --> O["Orchestrator / runtime governor<br/>State machine • budgets • permissions • deadlines"]
  O --> I["ITACHI agent<br/>Long-horizon planner • causal model • contingencies"]
  O --> S["SHISUI agent<br/>Decision-state analyst • stakeholders • beliefs • incentives"]
  I --> P["Shared plan + uncertainty ledger"]
  S --> D["Decision-state diagnosis"]
  D --> K["KOTOAMATSUKAMI layer<br/>Minimum authorized intervention"]
  K --> P
  P --> X["Policy gate + approval broker"]
  X -->|approved| E["Executor / tool adapters"]
  X -->|denied or unclear| H["Human review / safe stop"]
  E --> W["External world / systems"]
  W --> R["Observed results + artifacts"]
  R --> V["Independent evidence verifier"]
  V --> L["Append-only run ledger<br/>Evidence • assumptions • actions • outcomes"]
  V --> Z{"Verified success?"}
  Z -->|yes| C["Commit result / hand off"]
  Z -->|no| N["IZANAMI<br/>Detect repeats, oscillation, stagnation,<br/>unsupported progress claims"]
  N --> Q{"Same failed trajectory?"}
  Q -->|no: new evidence/progress| O
  Q -->|yes: stagnation/contradiction| G["IZANAGI<br/>Restore safe checkpoint or rebuild plan<br/>from verified state; preserve history"]
  G --> T["Replan with changed hypothesis<br/>or request human decision"]
  T --> O
  H --> L
  C --> L
  subgraph GUARDRAILS["Independent control plane — agents cannot override"]
    A["Least privilege • spend/time caps • rate limits"]
    B["Approval for high-impact/irreversible actions"]
    F["Rollback/compensation policy • kill switch"]
  end
  A -. constrains .-> O
  B -. gates .-> X
  F -. constrains .-> E
  F -. constrains .-> G
